{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001002", "type": "mod", "text": "釋曇鸞撰【大】，〔－〕【敦】，原本註曰釋曇鸞撰一作曇鸞法師作，愚案此皆後人所安蓋原文無撰者之號然欲顯別故今且從一本標之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001003", "type": "mod", "text": "如【大】，〔－〕【敦】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001004", "type": "mod", "text": "形【大】，〔－〕【敦】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001005", "type": "mod", "text": "阿【大】，〔－〕【敦】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001006", "type": "mod", "text": "請【大】，〔－〕【敦】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001007", "type": "mod", "text": "其【大】，〔－〕【敦】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001008", "type": "mod", "text": "清淨【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
